Variable map [derived]: MESA w_J = sqrt(3/2) w (w_J^2 = e_t, w = our velocity = MLT v_c).  Our local equation
   Dw/Dt = (A_s a² (sup − 2U w/a) − A_d w²)/ℓ   <=>   2 Dw_J/Dt = ξ0 + ξ1 w_J + ξ2 w_J²  with
   ξ0 = 2√(3/2) A_s a² sup/ℓ,   ξ1 = −4 A_s U a/ℓ,   ξ2 = −2√(2/3) A_d/ℓ   (J² = ξ1² − 4 ξ0 ξ2)
   (MESA: ξ2 = −(8√2/(3√3)) α_D/(α h) = −2.177 α_D/ℓ  =>  A_d = (4/3) α_D;  ξ0 ∝ α_S => A_s = (4/3) α_S)

